# Wowhead classic fallback

Look up Forever quests, items, and spells on `/forever/` first. If that page lists no rewards, or a reward link looks corrupted (empty page, broken item, missing name or icon), look up the same id on `/classic/`.

```
https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18466   →  no rewards or corrupted
https://www.wowhead.com/classic/item=18466   →  use this
```

- Same id, same kind of page: `quest`, `item`, or `spell`.
- Use the Classic page for the reward name, icon, quality, and counts.
- Still wait at least 2 seconds between Wowhead requests.
